  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Mementos stored inside the Timemap of a fedora object do not get their URIs transformed from the internal (fedora:timemap) to the external (fcr:versions) correctly.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Because this hack of mine",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-http-commons/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/commons/api/rdf/HttpResourceConverter.java#L260-L268"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-http-commons/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/commons/api/rdf/HttpResourceConverter.java#L260-L268",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Does not account for children of the TimeMap.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This task is to either figure out a clean way to transform all Timemap and children of Timemaps or add a section for Memento objects that does the transformation (because Mementos are always direct children of the Timemap).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
