     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" data-account-id=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" accountid=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Andrew Woods</a> <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" data-account-id=\"60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" accountid=\"60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Danny Bernstein</a> <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6089a4c12a753d0071341edb\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"6089a4c12a753d0071341edb\" data-account-id=\"6089a4c12a753d0071341edb\" accountid=\"6089a4c12a753d0071341edb\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Jared Whiklo</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1306\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1306</a></p>\n\n<p>This ended up being a lot more involved than I was expecting, in large part because it had to account for the wacky path resolution involved in having two timemaps for binaries.  I hope this won't seem too out there...</p>",
