  "description": "<p>Mementos stored inside the Timemap of a fedora object do not get their URIs transformed from the internal (fedora:timemap) to the external (fcr:versions) correctly.</p>\n\n<p>Because this hack of mine<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-http-commons/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/commons/api/rdf/HttpResourceConverter.java#L260-L268\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-http-commons/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/commons/api/rdf/HttpResourceConverter.java#L260-L268</a></p>\n\n<p>Does not account for children of the TimeMap.</p>\n\n<p>This task is to either figure out a clean way to transform all Timemap and children of Timemaps or add a section for Memento objects that does the transformation (because Mementos are always direct children of the Timemap).</p>",
